IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sgl-circulation`

-- Tests for sgl-circulation.l4 (s 183). Expected values were decided from the text before the module was run.
-- Period counting (6 weeks before 1 April 2026 is 18 February 2026; 1 week before is 25 March 2026) is the keel's convention P5, assumed and not ruled.

§ `s 183(2): the number of members needed`

-- arguments: voting rights of the requisitionists; total voting rights; requisitionists holding shares; total sum paid up on their shares
#ASSERT `s 183(2) the requisition is by the number of members the subsection specifies` 5 100 0 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(2) the requisition is by the number of members the subsection specifies` 4 100 0 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(2) the requisition is by the number of members the subsection specifies` 6 100 0 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(2) the requisition is by the number of members the subsection specifies` 0 0 0 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 100 members with an average of exactly $500 each: 50,000 in all
#ASSERT `s 183(2) the requisition is by the number of members the subsection specifies` 0 0 100 50000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(2) the requisition is by the number of members the subsection specifies` 0 0 100 49999 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(2) the requisition is by the number of members the subsection specifies` 0 0 99 100000 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(2) the requisition is by the number of members the subsection specifies` 0 0 150 75000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(2) the requisition is by the number of members the subsection specifies` 0 0 150 74999 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- either limb is enough
#ASSERT `s 183(2) the requisition is by the number of members the subsection specifies` 4 100 100 50000 EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `s 183(4) and (4A): the conditions on which the company is bound`

-- arguments: proposed to be passed by written means; the requisition requires notice of a resolution; the signed copy is deposited at the registered office; the day of deposit; the day of the meeting; an annual general meeting was called after the deposit; a sum reasonably sufficient is deposited
-- a resolution requisition: 6 weeks before 1 April 2026 is 18 February 2026
#ASSERT `s 183(4) the conditions on which the company is bound to give notice or to circulate are met` FALSE TRUE TRUE (Date 18 2 2026) (Date 1 4 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(4) the conditions on which the company is bound to give notice or to circulate are met` FALSE TRUE TRUE (Date 1 2 2026) (Date 1 4 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- deposited on 19 February 2026, one day late: no deeming unless an annual general meeting was called after the deposit
#ASSERT `s 183(4) the conditions on which the company is bound to give notice or to circulate are met` FALSE TRUE TRUE (Date 19 2 2026) (Date 1 4 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(4) the conditions on which the company is bound to give notice or to circulate are met` FALSE TRUE TRUE (Date 19 2 2026) (Date 1 4 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(4) the conditions on which the company is bound to give notice or to circulate are met` FALSE TRUE TRUE (Date 25 3 2026) (Date 1 4 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a requisition for a statement only: 1 week before 1 April 2026 is 25 March 2026
#ASSERT `s 183(4) the conditions on which the company is bound to give notice or to circulate are met` FALSE FALSE TRUE (Date 25 3 2026) (Date 1 4 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(4) the conditions on which the company is bound to give notice or to circulate are met` FALSE FALSE TRUE (Date 26 3 2026) (Date 1 4 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the deeming is for a requisition requiring notice of a resolution only
#ASSERT `s 183(4) the conditions on which the company is bound to give notice or to circulate are met` FALSE FALSE TRUE (Date 26 3 2026) (Date 1 4 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the copy is not deposited, or no sum is deposited or tendered
#ASSERT `s 183(4) the conditions on which the company is bound to give notice or to circulate are met` FALSE TRUE FALSE (Date 1 2 2026) (Date 1 4 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(4) the conditions on which the company is bound to give notice or to circulate are met` FALSE TRUE TRUE (Date 1 2 2026) (Date 1 4 2026) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a resolution proposed to be passed by written means is for subsection (4A)
#ASSERT `s 183(4) the conditions on which the company is bound to give notice or to circulate are met` TRUE TRUE TRUE (Date 1 2 2026) (Date 1 4 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- arguments: proposed to be passed by written means; the requisition is received by a director in legible form; the notice states that formal agreement is sought
#ASSERT `s 183(4A) the conditions on which the company is bound to give notice or to circulate are met` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(4A) the conditions on which the company is bound to give notice or to circulate are met` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(4A) the conditions on which the company is bound to give notice or to circulate are met` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(4A) the conditions on which the company is bound to give notice or to circulate are met` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 183(1): the duty`

-- arguments: the answers under (2), (4) and (4A); the resolution may properly be moved and is intended to be moved
#ASSERT `s 183(1)(a) the company must give members notice of the resolution` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(1)(a) the company must give members notice of the resolution` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(1)(a) the company must give members notice of the resolution` (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(1)(a) the company must give members notice of the resolution` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) NOTHING TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(1)(a) the company must give members notice of the resolution` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING NOTHING TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(1)(a) the company must give members notice of the resolution` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- arguments: the answers under (2), (4), (4A); the number of words; the statement is about the matter; the answer under (5)
#ASSERT `s 183(1)(b) the company must circulate the statement to members` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING 1000 TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(1)(b) the company must circulate the statement to members` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING 1001 TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(1)(b) the company must circulate the statement to members` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING 1000 FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(1)(b) the company must circulate the statement to members` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING 1000 TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(1)(b) the company must circulate the statement to members` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING 1000 TRUE NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(1)(b) the company must circulate the statement to members` (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING 1000 TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(1)(b) the company must circulate the statement to members` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) 10 TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `s 183(3) to (3C): service`

-- arguments: proposed to be passed by written means; served on each member entitled to notice; in a permitted manner
#ASSERT `s 183(3) the notice and statement are served as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(3) the notice and statement are served as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(3) the notice and statement are served as the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(3) the notice and statement are served as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- arguments: proposed to be passed by written means; copy served; notification served
#ASSERT `s 183(3A) the notice and statement are served as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(3A) the notice and statement are served as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(3A) the notice and statement are served as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(3A) the notice and statement are served as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- arguments: the member is one to whom notice of the meeting is not required to be sent; notice of the general effect is served
#ASSERT `s 183(3B) notice of the resolution has been given to the other member as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(3B) notice of the resolution has been given to the other member as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(3B) notice of the resolution has been given to the other member as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- arguments: proposed to be passed by written means; same manner; same time; not practicable at that time; as soon as practicable thereafter
#ASSERT `s 183(3C) the copy or notice is served or given as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(3C) the copy or notice is served or given as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(3C) the copy or notice is served or given as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(3C) the copy or notice is served or given as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(3C) the copy or notice is served or given as the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(3C) the copy or notice is served or given as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 183(4B) to (8)`

-- arguments: the requisition requests notification; the directors notified the person; without delay
#ASSERT `s 183(4B) the directors have complied with the duty to notify the date of receipt` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(4B) the directors have complied with the duty to notify the date of receipt` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(4B) the directors have complied with the duty to notify the date of receipt` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(4B) the directors have complied with the duty to notify the date of receipt` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- arguments: the company or an aggrieved person has applied; the Court is satisfied
#ASSERT `s 183(5) the company is not bound to circulate the statement` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(5) the company is not bound to circulate the statement` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(5) the company is not bound to circulate the statement` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(5) the Court may order the requisitionists to pay the company's costs of the application in whole or in part` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(5) the Court may order the requisitionists to pay the company's costs of the application in whole or in part` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(6) the resolution is business that may be dealt with at the annual general meeting` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(6) the resolution is business that may be dealt with at the annual general meeting` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- arguments: the notice was otherwise given in accordance with the section; members were omitted by accident
#ASSERT `s 183(6) notice is deemed to have been given despite the accidental omission` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(6) notice is deemed to have been given despite the accidental omission` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 183(6) notice is deemed to have been given despite the accidental omission` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- arguments: there is a default in complying with the section; the person is the company or an officer in default
#ASSERT `s 183(7) the person is guilty of the offence this subsection creates` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(7) the person is guilty of the offence this subsection creates` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(7) the person is guilty of the offence this subsection creates` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(7) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST (Penalty OF 5000, 0, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 183(7) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 183(7) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- arguments: legible before being sent; does not change form; agreed form; can be received legible or made legible
#ASSERT `s 183(8) the thing is in legible form or a permitted alternative form` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(8) the thing is in legible form or a permitted alternative form` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(8) the thing is in legible form or a permitted alternative form` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(8) the thing is in legible form or a permitted alternative form` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(8) the thing is in legible form or a permitted alternative form` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 183(8) the thing is in legible form or a permitted alternative form` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 183(8) the thing is in legible form or a permitted alternative form` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Regulative rules of s 183: no time limit, no breach path`

-- no time limit and no consequence is stated for these three duties: a late act still reads FULFILLED, and with no act the trace stays RESIDUAL (see NOTES.md, Rules with no breach path)
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 183(1)(a) the company must give members notice of the resolution (no time limit)` "Gamma Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Gamma Pte Ltd" DOES `s 183(1)(a) give members notice of the resolution` AT 400
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 183(1)(a) the company must give members notice of the resolution (no time limit)` "Gamma Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 183(1)(b) the company must circulate the statement to members (no time limit)` "Gamma Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Gamma Pte Ltd" DOES `s 183(1)(b) circulate the statement to members` AT 400
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 183(1)(b) the company must circulate the statement to members (no time limit)` "Gamma Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 183(4B) the directors must notify the specified person of the date of receipt (no time limit)` "Gamma Pte Ltd" 7 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Gamma Pte Ltd" DOES `s 183(4B) notify the specified person of the date of receipt` AT 400
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 183(4B) the directors must notify the specified person of the date of receipt (no time limit)` "Gamma Pte Ltd" 7 AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- a different party doing the act leaves the duty open
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 183(1)(a) the company must give members notice of the resolution (no time limit)` "Gamma Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Delta Pte Ltd" DOES `s 183(1)(a) give members notice of the resolution` AT 5
